1. First Code: showdata_Click
Purpose: To display the date entered by the user.
This code uses the following variables:
• string: Stores text.
• dayofweek: Stores the day of the week, such as Monday.
• month: Stores the month, such as January.
• year: Stores the year, such as 2026.
• showdata: Combines the date information.
How it works
1. It gets data from the TextBoxes.
2. It combines the day, month, and year.
3. It displays the date in dateout label. Text.
Example output:
Monday January 2026
2. Second Code: clear_Click
Purpose: To clear all the entered date information.
This code uses the following commands:
• txtdayofweek. Clear (); - Clears the day of the week.
• txtnamemonth. Clear(); — Clears the month.
• txtdaymonth. Clear() • Clears the day of